	"data": "Meta Immersive Web SDK (IWSDK)\n\nMeta's official WebXR SDK with spatial UI system. HTML/CSS-like DSL for authoring spatial UI.\nRepo: <https://github.com/facebook/immersive-web-sdk>\nLicense: Open source (check repo)\nStatus: v0.4.2, NPM published, actively maintained by Meta\n\nWhat It Provides\nUIKit — native 3D UI runtime with MSDF text, batched panels, Yoga Flexbox layout\nUIKitML — HTML/CSS-like DSL for authoring spatial UI\nVite plugin for compilation\nDOM-like API (getElementById,…",
